READS (14):
(endpoints below are byte-for-byte the paths in HttpTelemetryRepository.kt, which reproduce the web `request(...)` URLs verbatim — the request() client auto-prefixes /api/v1, so hooks/holders carry no prefix)

 1. useSignals                  -> TelemetryStore.signals(vehicleId)              GET /signals/{vehicleID}/available           derive: TelemetryDerivations.signalNames (safeArray + {name})  TTL 60s (STANDARD)
 2. useVehicleLiveSignals       -> TelemetryStore.vehicleLiveSignals(vehicleId)   GET /signals/{vehicleID}/live                                                                            TTL 5s (REALTIME)
 3. useSignalStats              -> TelemetryStore.signalStats(vehicleId)          GET /signals/{vehicleID}/stats                                                                           TTL 60s
 4. useSignalHistory            -> TelemetryStore.signalHistory(vid,sig,hours)    GET /signals/{vehicleID}/{signalName}/history?hours=               query: telemetrySignalHistoryQuery  TTL 60s
 5. useSignalLog                -> TelemetryStore.signalLog(vid,sig,hours,pg,sz)  GET /signals/{vehicleID}/{signalName}/history?hours=&page=&page_size=  query: telemetrySignalLogQuery; NOTE web reuses the /history endpoint (distinct query key 'signal-log')  TTL 60s
 6. useSignalDiff               -> TelemetryStore.signalDiff(vid,sig,from,to)     GET /signals/{vehicleID}/{signalName}/history?from=&to=            query: telemetrySignalDiffQuery; NOTE web reuses the /history endpoint (distinct query key 'signal-diff')  TTL 60s
 7. useSignalSnapshot           -> TelemetryStore.signalSnapshot(vid,at,signals)  GET /signals/{vehicleID}/snapshot?at=&signals=          query: telemetrySnapshotQuery (omit empty)        TTL 60s
 8. useSignalDiffServer         -> TelemetryStore.signalDiffServer(vid,a,b,sig)   GET /signals/{vehicleID}/diff?at_a=&at_b=&signals=      query: telemetryDiffServerQuery (omit empty)      TTL 60s
 9. useSignalGaps               -> TelemetryStore.signalGaps(vehicleId)           GET /signals/{vehicleID}/live   NOTE web reuses the /live endpoint (distinct query key 'signal-gaps')  derive: TelemetryDerivations.signalGaps (.signals ?? {})  TTL 60s
10. useMQTTStatus               -> TelemetryStore.mqttStatus()                    GET /telemetry                               derive: normalizeMqttStatus (record->array, vin inject)  TTL 60s
11. useSignalCatalog            -> TelemetryStore.signalCatalog()                 GET /signals/catalog (deprecated/404, ported faithfully)                                                  TTL 5min (SLOW)
12. useSignalObservations       -> TelemetryStore.signalObservations(params)      GET /signals/observations?vehicle_id=&field=&since=&until=&limit=  query: telemetryObservationsQuery; derive adaptObservations  TTL 5s (REALTIME)
13. useFleetTelemetryErrorVINs  -> TelemetryStore.fleetTelemetryErrorVINs()       GET /tesla/fleet-telemetry/error-vins                                                                     TTL 60s
14. useFleetTelemetryErrors     -> TelemetryStore.fleetTelemetryErrors(vin?)      GET /tesla/fleet-telemetry/errors?vin=      query: telemetryErrorsQuery (omit empty)                  TTL 60s

MUTATIONS (2):
15. useRefreshFleetTelemetryErrorVINs -> TelemetryStore.refreshFleetTelemetryErrorVINs()  POST /tesla/fleet-telemetry/error-vins/refresh  invalidates family "fleet-telemetry-error-vins"
16. useRefreshFleetTelemetryErrors    -> TelemetryStore.refreshFleetTelemetryErrors()      POST /tesla/fleet-telemetry/errors/refresh      invalidates family "fleet-telemetry-errors"

